WEBVTT

NOTE
English subtitles of the film about Niko and the foundation, transcribed verbatim from the subtitles
burned into the picture (nkfund.world, home page). Timings measured from the 720p file.

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.150
Since his childhood, Niko has been the author
of a number of social projects

2
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.950
some of which he could not complete

3
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.100
The Nikos Foundation will serve to complete these projects

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.350
Niko had no boundaries, that's what his created platform Feedc served

5
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:31.100
With the platform, it allowed people to write what they
wanted and get the information they were interested in

6
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.750
The started things did not stop

7
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.100
For our family, it was everyday

8
00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:55.400
We decided to gather in one space for all these things
and united all this under the Nikos Foundation

9
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.700
In the conditions of the pandemic

10
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:08.750
Niko and the Feeds team were able to quickly create
the first Georgian free distance learning platform Feedc Edu

11
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:17.950
Due to the global situation, it is very important
to support people who are focused on getting an education

12
00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:25.950
Therefore, Feedc Edu and Nikos Foundation
share one goal: a better and sustainable future

13
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.350
It's true that I come from a different field

14
00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:37.700
but Niko's innovation, attitude, purposefulness were contagious to everyone

15
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:47.750
I liked what he was doing with Feeds, the general concept
that there are no borders and anyone can go global

16
00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:56.000
I am proud that we were on the Forbes list of under 30 together
and I believe that it has become an example for many young people

17
00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.950
Due to the fact that I have been working in the digital world for years

18
00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.150
and my skills are based on a number of innovations

19
00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:08.000
Niko was a clear example for me of how

20
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:18.700
despite the fact that Georgia is a small country at least in Georgia,
a person created an innovative product and globalized it

21
00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:28.500
Niko was the best example of this and I am very happy that together
with Niko I became the winner of Forbes under 30

22
00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:35.700
For years, the young people of Jgali village dreamed
of an IT room equipped with modern technologies

23
00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:41.850
Niko turned out to be the person who made
our dream a reality and just a few months ago

24
00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:46.400
an IT room named after Niko Kvaratskhelia
was opened in the public school of Jgali village

25
00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:54.000
I, as a representative of Niko's generation and also a person
who was with him among the Forbes under 30 winners,

26
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.900
I am really proud of his job, which was
presented in Georgia and beyond its borders

27
00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:04.800
It is a great honor for me that this scholarship
is financed by the Niko's Foundation

28
00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.600
Niko is a great motivation for me and
I hope Georgia will have someone like him again

29
00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:16.350
All the social projects that our family has been doing until now
will be implemented by the Nikos Foundation
